00:06:56,950 --> 00:06:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll be stuck in the middle</font></font>

166
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and get on both their bad sides.</font></font>

167
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I don't wanna do that.</font></font>

168
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That safe, cautious approach</font></font>

169
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">feels outdated to me.</font></font>

170
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look,</font></font>

171
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">clients pick a consulting firm</font></font>

172
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because they want a clear stance</font></font>

173
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and a definitive opinion.</font></font>

174
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:09,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So as a friend,</font></font>

175
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I'm all wishy-washy right now,</font></font>

176
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I feel like a bad friend.</font></font>

177
00:07:16,270 --> 00:07:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if I get on both their bad sides,</font></font>

178
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's a problem for later, right?</font></font>

179
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But now it's killing me to just sit here</font></font>

180
00:07:21,830 --> 00:07:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and do nothing.</font></font>

181
00:07:27,310 --> 00:07:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm gonna go make a call.</font></font>

182
00:07:28,070 --> 00:07:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me ten minutes, and I'll be back to work.</font></font>

183
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xu Chi]</font></font>

184
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello?</font></font>

185
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you at the airport?</font></font>

186
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know that too?</font></font>

187
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You want me to bring you back</font></font>

188
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">souvenirs from South America?</font></font>

189
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be honest with me,</font></font>

190
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when you picked up my call,</font></font>

191
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">were you really disappointed?</font></font>

192
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were hoping</font></font>

193
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:07,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it was Tianna calling, right?</font></font>

194
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:12,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She won't. With that temper of hers...</font></font>

195
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhao Heng, listen to me.</font></font>

196
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We all want equality</font></font>

197
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in love.</font></font>

198
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We all want to be evenly matched.</font></font>

199
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But let me ask you,</font></font>

200
00:08:19,950 --> 00:08:21,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are you actually on equal footing with Tianna?</font></font>

201
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know her weak spot</font></font>

202
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is that she never felt secure</font></font>

203
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in her own family.</font></font>

204
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And yet</font></font>

205
00:08:26,750 --> 00:08:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you went and did</font></font>

206
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the one thing she hates most,</font></font>

207
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:30,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and then expected her to treat you rationally.</font></font>

208
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:32,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianna was with me</font></font>

209
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before she came to find you.</font></font>

210
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She thought</font></font>

211
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">her dad was riding you hard again,</font></font>

212
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and she panicked.</font></font>

213
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She almost twisted her ankle</font></font>

214
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">running to the parking lot.</font></font>

215
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you know that?</font></font>

216
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You said you lost the bet.</font></font>

217
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhao Heng, is it really all or nothing for you</font></font>

218
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when it comes to love?</font></font>

219
00:08:45,270 --> 00:08:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know</font></font>

220
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's totally biased of me</font></font>

221
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to come at you</font></font>

222
00:08:49,270 --> 00:08:50,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for taking Tianna's side right now.</font></font>

223
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But as a friend,</font></font>

224
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really don't want you to regret this.</font></font>

225
00:08:56,910 --> 00:08:57,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In two months,</font></font>

226
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">love can snap</font></font>

227
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">like a thread.</font></font>

228
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if you want to tie it back together,</font></font>

229
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:05,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at ten thousand kilometers apart,</font></font>

230
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can you even reach it?</font></font>

231
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, man.</font></font>

232
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I pushed too hard on the toilet.</font></font>

233
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Feeling a little dizzy.</font></font>

234
00:09:25,750 --> 00:09:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doesn't your watch check</font></font>

235
00:09:26,550 --> 00:09:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">blood pressure?</font></font>

236
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me borrow it.</font></font>

237
00:09:32,750 --> 00:09:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's your watch?</font></font>

238
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:34,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You lost it?</font></font>

239
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hold on.</font></font>

240
00:09:35,630 --> 00:09:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me track it on my phone.</font></font>

241
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhao Heng's Smartwatch]</font></font>

242
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Parking lot P1?</font></font>

243
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not right.</font></font>

244
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We took a ride</font></font>

245
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">straight to the departures level.</font></font>

246
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How's your watch in here?</font></font>

247
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe you left the watch in the car,</font></font>

248
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the driver went to P1 to wait for passengers?</font></font>

249
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're dead set</font></font>

250
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on mooching off me.</font></font>

251
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're in no position to talk about equality.</font></font>

252
00:09:58,790 --> 00:09:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bu Tianna!</font></font>

253
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where are you going?</font></font>

254
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're about to board!</font></font>

255
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianna.</font></font>

256
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I said I wanted to break up,</font></font>

257
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was just acting out.</font></font>

258
00:11:39,870 --> 00:11:40,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was gaslighting you.</font></font>

259
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to make sure you couldn't leave me.</font></font>

260
00:11:50,030 --> 00:11:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But deep down, I know</font></font>

261
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">no one could ever replace you in my heart.</font></font>

262
00:11:58,910 --> 00:11:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So,</font></font>

263
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will you forgive me?</font></font>

264
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not here for you.</font></font>

265
00:12:10,030 --> 00:12:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right.</font></font>

266
00:12:11,510 --> 00:12:12,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're just passing by.</font></font>

267
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the one who came for you.</font></font>

268
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You scumbag.</font></font>

269
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why do you always tell me what sounds good?</font></font>

270
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

271
00:12:23,910 --> 00:12:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a scumbag.</font></font>

272
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:25,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm awful.</font></font>

273
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm trash.</font></font>

274
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I had an ulterior motive this whole time.</font></font>

275
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:30,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So,</font></font>

276
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you still love me?</font></font>

277
00:13:17,510 --> 00:13:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And then?</font></font>

278
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What happened next?</font></font>

279
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:20,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And then</font></font>

280
00:13:21,150 --> 00:13:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">his colleague called</font></font>

281
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and told Zhao Heng to board.</font></font>

282
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then he and Tianna agreed to</font></font>

283
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:25,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">video chat</font></font>

284
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for at least half an hour every day.</font></font>

285
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After that, Zhao Heng flew off.</font></font>

286
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's it?</font></font>

287
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's so not romantic.</font></font>

288
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I figured Zhao Heng</font></font>

289
00:13:34,630 --> 00:13:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would've at least changed his ticket</font></font>

290
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and stayed one more night.</font></font>

291
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Or Bu Tianna</font></font>

292
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:38,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would've bought a ticket</font></font>

293
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and gone to Venezuela with him.</font></font>

294
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Shen,</font></font>

295
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you think this is some idol drama?</font></font>

296
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Feelings matter, of course.</font></font>

297
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But that's just between two people.</font></font>

298
00:13:46,510 --> 00:13:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Work</font></font>

299
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">involves the whole team.</font></font>

300
00:13:48,270 --> 00:13:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've gotta make trade-offs.</font></font>

301
00:13:50,910 --> 00:13:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So,</font></font>

302
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:53,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to you, consulting people,</font></font>

303
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:55,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">work always comes before love, huh?</font></font>

304
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:57,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">First,</font></font>

305
00:13:57,910 --> 00:13:59,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I partly agree with you.</font></font>

306
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Second,</font></font>

307
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think I hear</font></font>

308
00:14:02,270 --> 00:14:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a little bitterness in there.</font></font>

309
00:14:04,270 --> 00:14:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Third,</font></font>

310
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my boss</font></font>

311
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is blowing up my phone.</font></font>

312
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:08,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'm gonna head out.</font></font>

313
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll leave you two to your date.</font></font>

314
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something's off.</font></font>

315
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That girl's definitely got something going on.</font></font>

316
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But she really is thoughtful.</font></font>

317
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh,</font></font>

318
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">try this.</font></font>

319
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:26,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Foie gras.</font></font>

320
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's a bit rich,</font></font>

321
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but it's loaded with iron.</font></font>

322
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good for your blood.</font></font>

323
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Try it.</font></font>

324
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good?</font></font>

325
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have some more.</font></font>

326
00:14:38,670 --> 00:14:39,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wish you could take</font></font>

327
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a vacation sometime.</font></font>

328
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then we'll go somewhere for a couple of days.</font></font>

329
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can find a nice</font></font>

330
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:44,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">lake or ocean</font></font>

331
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and just relax.</font></font>

332
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lately, I've even dreamed</font></font>

333
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:48,770
