00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they couldn't get used to the food there.</font></font>

502
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about Saudi Arabia?</font></font>

503
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I was little,</font></font>

504
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:22,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I loved this comic</font></font>

505
00:20:22,070 --> 00:20:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my mom left me.</font></font>

506
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There was a tower that reached for the heavens.</font></font>

507
00:20:25,510 --> 00:20:26,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My mom said</font></font>

508
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">date palms grew in a row at the bottom.</font></font>

509
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The dates were sweet as honey.</font></font>

510
00:20:30,350 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She loved eating them.</font></font>

511
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The yellow spiral tower?</font></font>

512
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, that one.</font></font>

513
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:39,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's in Iraq,</font></font>

514
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not Saudi.</font></font>

515
00:20:45,990 --> 00:20:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'd have to take so many days off, though.</font></font>

516
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Chi, if you wanna go,</font></font>

517
00:20:49,150 --> 00:20:50,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we can take as many days off as we need.</font></font>

518
00:20:54,590 --> 00:20:55,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forget it, forget it.</font></font>

519
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if we can get the time off,</font></font>

520
00:20:58,040 --> 00:20:59,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">getting there would be a hassle.</font></font>

521
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where do you wanna go?</font></font>

522
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:03,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I love the ocean.</font></font>

523
00:21:04,310 --> 00:21:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanna go to the Blue Hole in Dahab.</font></font>

524
00:21:07,550 --> 00:21:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They also call it the Eye of the Ocean.</font></font>

525
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's the easiest deep blue sea cave</font></font>

526
00:21:11,590 --> 00:21:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for tourists to get to.</font></font>

527
00:21:13,310 --> 00:21:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then let's go there.</font></font>

528
00:21:15,590 --> 00:21:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've got a whole month.</font></font>

529
00:21:17,350 --> 00:21:18,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can hit the Tower of Babel first,</font></font>

530
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then the Blue Hole.</font></font>

531
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They say</font></font>

532
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that the Tower of Babel is where humans</font></font>

533
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">get closest to the heavens.</font></font>

534
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:24,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We could go from</font></font>

535
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the highest point on Earth</font></font>

536
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">straight to the deepest.</font></font>

537
00:21:31,270 --> 00:21:32,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How do you</font></font>

538
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">make everything</font></font>

539
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sound so poetic?</font></font>

540
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Must be that mature man charm</font></font>

541
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you talked about.</font></font>

542
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're so petty,</font></font>

543
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you hold grudges.</font></font>

544
00:21:52,030 --> 00:21:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

545
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I hold grudges.</font></font>

546
00:21:54,830 --> 00:21:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And right now,</font></font>

547
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm getting revenge.</font></font>

548
00:21:57,270 --> 00:21:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here I come!</font></font>

549
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:01,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing? We have to get up early tomorrow.</font></font>

550
00:22:27,830 --> 00:22:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go from the highest point on Earth...</font></font>

551
00:22:43,350 --> 00:22:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We could go from</font></font>

552
00:22:48,030 --> 00:22:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the highest point on Earth...</font></font>

553
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[I'm in Beijing]
It's that supervisor surnamed Liu</font></font>

554
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from All Buy's quality inspection department.</font></font>

555
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before it happened,</font></font>

556
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he posted a farewell video</font></font>

557
00:23:01,110 --> 00:23:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on a video app.</font></font>

558
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:03,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Said All Buy and Hezong teamed up</font></font>

559
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to force him out.</font></font>

560
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That consultant Ye</font></font>

561
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">swore up and down</font></font>

562
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that after optimizing the process,</font></font>

563
00:23:11,830 --> 00:23:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Statement]
it wouldn't cause us any trouble.</font></font>

564
00:23:14,680 --> 00:23:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What a liar.</font></font>

565
00:23:18,750 --> 00:23:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're exactly the trouble</font></font>

566
00:23:20,830 --> 00:23:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All Buy wants to cut loose!</font></font>

567
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Word is, Mr. Liu</font></font>

568
00:23:30,070 --> 00:23:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has over three million in mortgage debt.</font></font>

569
00:23:31,640 --> 00:23:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His kid's still in the hospital.</font></font>

570
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That AI quality inspection system</font></font>

571
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All Buy brought in</font></font>

572
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">uses robotic electronic eyes</font></font>

573
00:23:37,550 --> 00:23:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and probes</font></font>

574
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to replace human inspectors.</font></font>

575
00:23:39,790 --> 00:23:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One machine can replace</font></font>

576
00:23:41,270 --> 00:23:42,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">fifty quality inspectors.</font></font>

577
00:23:42,590 --> 00:23:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hotspot Intel]
So listen up, folks,</font></font>

578
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:44,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">AI</font></font>

579
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">doesn't just revolutionize industries.</font></font>

580
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:46,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It can cost lives.</font></font>

581
00:23:46,790 --> 00:23:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Mr. Su. - Mr. Su!</font></font>

582
00:23:48,310 --> 00:23:49,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is what Mr. Liu said</font></font>

583
00:23:49,310 --> 00:23:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in his video true?</font></font>

584
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did your company spend a fortune</font></font>

585
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">hiring consultants to lay people off,</font></font>

586
00:23:52,790 --> 00:23:53,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">instead of giving old employees</font></font>

587
00:23:53,590 --> 00:23:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">fair compensation?</font></font>

588
00:23:54,480 --> 00:23:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please answer directly.</font></font>

589
00:23:55,070 --> 00:23:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Su.</font></font>

590
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please answer directly.</font></font>

591
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Su.</font></font>

592
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Su. Did someone die at your company?</font></font>

593
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did someone jump?</font></font>

594
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you sure HR</font></font>

595
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">never pressured him to resign?</font></font>

596
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

597
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not what you told us back then.</font></font>

598
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This all happened so suddenly.</font></font>

599
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fine. I'll talk to Mr. Ye.</font></font>

600
00:24:16,750 --> 00:24:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I understand.</font></font>

601
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There you are.</font></font>

602
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The hospital said</font></font>

603
00:24:22,830 --> 00:24:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Liu</font></font>

604
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is out of the ICU.</font></font>

605
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He hit a light sign on the 29th floor,</font></font>

606
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then landed on a platform on the 7th.</font></font>

607
00:24:27,350 --> 00:24:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's not in any danger.</font></font>

608
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank god.</font></font>

609
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to see him right now.</font></font>

610
00:24:32,310 --> 00:24:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll come with you.</font></font>

611
00:24:35,030 --> 00:24:35,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xu Chi!</font></font>

612
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All Buy's on the line for you.</font></font>

613
00:24:39,590 --> 00:24:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You go ahead. I'll catch up.</font></font>

614
00:24:43,110 --> 00:24:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Richard!</font></font>

615
00:24:46,750 --> 00:24:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you going to the hospital?</font></font>

616
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:51,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The crisis PR team is already there.</font></font>

617
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't need to go.</font></font>

618
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Kai,</font></font>

619
00:24:57,030 --> 00:24:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to apologize</font></font>

620
00:24:58,830 --> 00:24:59,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to Mr. Liu in person.</font></font>

621
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've always handled overseas projects.</font></font>

622
00:25:02,790 --> 00:25:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Domestic projects have always been yours.</font></font>

623
00:25:04,830 --> 00:25:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We can't take this one.</font></font>

624
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're back already?</font></font>

625
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Kai said</font></font>

626
00:25:16,310 --> 00:25:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not ready to go yet.</font></font>

627
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I get how that video</font></font>

628
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">affected you.</font></font>

629
00:25:20,830 --> 00:25:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

630
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you need to control your guilt.</font></font>

631
00:25:23,510 --> 00:25:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Liu didn't mention your name.</font></font>

632
00:25:25,510 --> 00:25:26,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you go apologize now,</font></font>

633
00:25:26,590 --> 00:25:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you're taking all the blame</font></font>

634
00:25:28,270 --> 00:25:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on yourself.</font></font>

635
00:25:29,750 --> 00:25:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He just got stuck</font></font>

636
00:25:31,240 --> 00:25:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in his own head for a moment.</font></font>

637
00:25:32,590 --> 00:25:34,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's fine now.</font></font>

638
00:25:36,350 --> 00:25:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Kai,</font></font>

639
00:25:38,350 --> 00:25:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's a human life.</font></font>

640
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

641
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I get how you feel.</font></font>

642
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's like, I didn't kill him,</font></font>

643
00:25:44,070 --> 00:25:45,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but he died because of me.</font></font>

644
00:25:45,350 --> 00:25:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But how we handle this case now</font></font>

645
00:25:48,270 --> 00:25:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't just about Mr. Liu.</font></font>

646
00:25:49,830 --> 00:25:51,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's about billions in business,</font></font>

647
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and new jobs for hundreds of employees.</font></font>

648
00:25:55,110 --> 00:25:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't lose sight of the big picture.</font></font>

649
00:25:58,480 --> 00:25:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Kai.</font></font>

650
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a partner.</font></font>

651
00:26:02,350 --> 00:26:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is my project.</font></font>

652
00:26:04,310 --> 00:26:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I get first say over this!</font></font>

653
00:26:09,160 --> 00:26:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are a lot of reporters outside the hospital.</font></font>

654
00:26:10,750 --> 00:26:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you go now, you could cause</font></font>

655
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:12,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">irreversible second-hand harm</font></font>

656
00:26:12,830 --> 00:26:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to Mr. Liu and his family.</font></font>

657
00:26:14,070 --> 00:26:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you thought about that?</font></font>

658
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Setting aside that I'm your boss,</font></font>

659
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as a friend,</font></font>

660
00:26:19,270 --> 00:26:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm suggesting you go home and rest.</font></font>

661
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait till you're in a better place</font></font>

662
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and PR has things under control.</font></font>

663
00:26:25,070 --> 00:26:26,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It won't be too late then.</font></font>

664
00:26:26,550 --> 00:26:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But Mr. Kai...</font></font>

665
00:26:27,270 --> 00:26:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Enough!</font></font>

666
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Richard, I've got a lot of fires</font></font>

667
00:26:29,310 --> 00:26:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to put out right now.</font></font>

668
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you just give it a rest?</font></font>

669
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Chi,</font></font>

670
00:26:34,750 --> 00:26:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">actually, back when we were on the Yuanzhou project,</font></font>

671
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I started thinking about something.</font></font>

672
00:26:40,160 --> 00:26:41,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We in consulting</font></font>

673
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">shouldn't just be responsible to the companies we serve.</font></font>

674
00:26:45,550 --> 00:26:47,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We should be responsible to the actual people.</font></font>

675
00:26:49,720 --> 00:26:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So</font></font>

676
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:53,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to go apologize to Mr. Liu.</font></font>

677
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Whether Mr. Kai agrees or not,</font></font>

678
00:26:56,070 --> 00:26:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going.</font></font>

679
00:27:03,750 --> 00:27:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go with you then.</font></font>

680
00:27:08,830 --> 00:27:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you okay?</font></font>

681
00:27:13,030 --> 00:27:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You seem</font></font>

682
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a little off today.</font></font>

683
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just mentioned Yuanzhou.</font></font>

684
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Were you thinking about Wen Ruosen?</font></font>

685
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My kid's only eight.</font></font>

686
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really don't want to jump off a building.</font></font>

687
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if you don't save me,</font></font>

688
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I really will jump.</font></font>

689
00:27:32,550 --> 00:27:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Before, you didn't want to be</font></font>

690
00:27:34,030 --> 00:27:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">too hard on him</font></font>

691
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">after hearing that he wanted to jump.</font></font>

692
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

693
00:27:43,920 --> 00:27:44,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's on me.</font></font>

694
00:27:47,590 --> 00:27:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright then.</font></font>

695
00:27:50,550 --> 00:27:51,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll explain it all to you sometime.</font></font>

696
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">PR says someone from Xinrui Finance</font></font>

697
00:28:04,030 --> 00:28:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is coming to interview soon.</font></font>

698
00:28:05,110 --> 00:28:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you up for it?</font></font>

699
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you go home and rest?</font></font>

700
00:28:10,590 --> 00:28:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll handle things here.</font></font>

701
00:28:14,590 --> 00:28:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

702
00:28:17,350 --> 00:28:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hezong's bid</font></font>

703
00:28:18,310 --> 00:28:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was only for All Buy's overseas projects.</font></font>

704
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As for personnel changes</font></font>

705
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the client's domestic</font></font>

706
00:28:22,350 --> 00:28:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">business department,</font></font>

707
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we don't have more detailed information.</font></font>

708
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So, does Hezong bear any responsibility</font></font>

709
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for All Buy's jumping incident?</font></font>

710
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not at liberty to answer that.</font></font>

711
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is an internal matter</font></font>

712
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for All Buy.</font></font>

713
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hezong only offered suggestions</font></font>

714
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for their overseas projects.</font></font>

715
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Young Ye Xinzhi]</font></font>

716
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Kai,</font></font>

717
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that's a human life.</font></font>

718
00:29:18,590 --> 00:29:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hezong is a top consulting firm.</font></font>

719
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And I'm the project lead.</font></font>

720
00:29:23,070 --> 00:29:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think we have an obligation</font></font>

721
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to apologize to the victim</font></font>

722
00:29:25,790 --> 00:29:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and admit our mistakes to the public.</font></font>

723
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is what we have to do!</font></font>

724
00:29:28,070 --> 00:29:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No, no!</font></font>

725
00:29:30,790 --> 00:29:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We didn't make a mistake.</font></font>

726
00:29:32,110 --> 00:29:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Consulting firms</font></font>

727
00:29:33,070 --> 00:29:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are only advisors,</font></font>

728
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">never the party involved.</font></font>

729
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:36,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your team provided a business</font></font>

730
00:29:37,030 --> 00:29:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">process integration plan for overseas expansion</font></font>

731
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that hasn't even been implemented yet.</font></font>

732
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Liu's issue</font></font>

733
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:42,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">happened because All Buy</font></font>

734
00:29:42,350 --> 00:29:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">messed things up</font></font>

735
00:29:42,880 --> 00:29:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">while using AI to overhaul</font></font>

736
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">their workflow.</font></font>

737
00:29:44,550 --> 00:29:46,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It has nothing to do with Hezong.</font></font>

738
00:30:01,300 --> 00:30:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hezong Consulting]</font></font>

739
00:30:04,590 --> 00:30:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xu Chi.</font></font>

740
00:30:06,070 --> 00:30:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xu Chi?</font></font>

741
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Got a minute?</font></font>

742
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's talk.</font></font>

743
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to know</font></font>

744
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how you assess</font></font>

745
00:30:14,310 --> 00:30:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the impact of this All Buy incident</font></font>

746
00:30:15,510 --> 00:30:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on the company.</font></font>

747
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Richard and I both think...</font></font>

748
00:30:18,070 --> 00:30:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sorry.</font></font>

749
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just want to hear your personal opinion.</font></font>

750
00:30:20,070 --> 00:30:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Objective, calm, concise,</font></font>

751
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and neutral.</font></font>

752
00:30:26,310 --> 00:30:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My personal stance...</font></font>

753
00:30:31,270 --> 00:30:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's hard for me to be completely neutral.</font></font>

754
00:30:33,310 --> 00:30:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because this whole thing</font></font>

755
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:35,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has affected me a lot too.</font></font>

756
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can only try my best to calmly</font></font>

757
00:30:39,070 --> 00:30:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">share some of my observations with you.</font></font>

758
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Public opinion</font></font>

759
00:30:45,160 --> 00:30:46,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't a big deal right now.</font></font>

760
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because to</font></font>

761
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">everyday people,</font></font>

762
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hezong and industry consultants</font></font>

763
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">are still pretty unfamiliar concepts.</font></font>

764
00:30:51,920 --> 00:30:53,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But long term,</font></font>

765
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the industry will have</font></font>

766
00:30:54,830 --> 00:30:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">negative views of Hezong</font></font>

767
00:30:56,310 --> 00:30:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for at least half a year, maybe more.</font></font>

768
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's a very precise analysis.</font></font>

769
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But still too conservative.</font></font>

770
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hezong ranked number one</font></font>

771
00:31:06,550 --> 00:31:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in sales among domestic</font></font>

772
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">consulting firms last year,</font></font>

773
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:09,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but with the European</font></font>

774
00:31:09,830 --> 00:31:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and American markets shrinking,</font></font>

775
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our business volume has dropped sharply.</font></font>

776
00:31:17,510 --> 00:31:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can scroll down.</font></font>

777
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">To say the least,</font></font>

778
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:24,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hezong is facing its winter right now.</font></font>

779
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The only ones with consulting budgets now</font></font>

780
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:28,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hezong Consulting]
are the big internet firms.</font></font>

781
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:29,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Global Revenue Analysis by Region]
So I'm really counting</font></font>

782
00:31:29,590 --> 00:31:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on Richard's</font></font>

783
00:31:30,790 --> 00:31:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All Buy project to deliver smoothly,</font></font>

784
00:31:32,350 --> 00:31:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">become the company's</font></font>

785
00:31:33,030 --> 00:31:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">new breakthrough,</font></font>

786
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and lead other business</font></font>

787
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">lines upward.</font></font>

788
00:31:39,830 --> 00:31:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Richard apologizes</font></font>

789
00:31:41,070 --> 00:31:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and takes responsibility</font></font>

790
00:31:42,350 --> 00:31:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">out of personal impulse,</font></font>

791
00:31:44,550 --> 00:31:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it could very well affect</font></font>

792
00:31:45,790 --> 00:31:47,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the whole project moving forward.</font></font>

793
00:31:47,790 --> 00:31:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If All Buy</font></font>

794
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ends our cooperation</font></font>

795
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because of this,</font></font>

796
00:31:51,750 --> 00:31:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our internet projects</font></font>

797
00:31:53,270 --> 00:31:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will take a major hit.</font></font>

798
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What we lose then</font></font>

799
00:31:56,310 --> 00:31:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">isn't just your team's effort</font></font>

800
00:31:58,960 --> 00:31:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and money,</font></font>

801
00:32:00,350 --> 00:32:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but Hezong's future.</font></font>

802
00:32:06,070 --> 00:32:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I understand.</font></font>

803
00:32:09,310 --> 00:32:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Give me a little time.</font></font>

804
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll talk to him.</font></font>

805
00:32:12,070 --> 00:32:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make sure he keeps his emotions in check.</font></font>

806
00:32:13,590 --> 00:32:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

807
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What I need is for you to fully take over</font></font>

808
00:32:16,790 --> 00:32:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the All Buy project,</font></font>

809
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">completely shut down this incident,</font></font>

810
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and keep fulfilling the consulting contract.</font></font>

811
00:32:21,070 --> 00:32:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And Richard absolutely cannot know.</font></font>

812
00:32:25,110 --> 00:32:26,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can't do that. Absolutely not.</font></font>

813
00:32:28,750 --> 00:32:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xu Chi, you know him better than I do.</font></font>

814
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I've known him for over ten years.</font></font>

815
00:32:32,350 --> 00:32:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never seen him</font></font>

816
00:32:33,350 --> 00:32:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">lose it like this</font></font>

817
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">on any project.</font></font>

818
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I guess Mr. Liu's jump</font></font>

819
00:32:38,590 --> 00:32:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">triggered severe</font></font>

820
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">PTSD in him.</font></font>

821
00:32:40,830 --> 00:32:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just now, I asked him</font></font>

822
00:32:41,830 --> 00:32:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to follow PR's arrangements.</font></font>

823
00:32:42,790 --> 00:32:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His reaction was intense.</font></font>

824
00:32:43,790 --> 00:32:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Public opinion is on fire.</font></font>

825
00:32:44,640 --> 00:32:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For the company's sake,</font></font>

826
00:32:45,270 --> 00:32:46,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to sideline him for now.</font></font>

827
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're the number two on the team.</font></font>

828
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want you to step up in this crisis,</font></font>

829
00:32:50,590 --> 00:32:51,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">handle the client,</font></font>

830
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">manage the fallout,</font></font>

831
00:32:52,680 --> 00:32:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and deliver the final results.</font></font>

832
00:32:55,590 --> 00:32:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Kai, I really can't.</font></font>

833
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This project...</font></font>

834
00:32:58,550 --> 00:32:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xu Chi, I hope you understand this.</font></font>

835
00:33:00,510 --> 00:33:01,460
